# Proxy list — one proxy per line (this file is gitignored when you add real credentials)
#
# Supported formats:
#   http://username:password@host:port
#   socks5://username:password@host:port
#   host:port:username:password
#   host:port
#
# Residential proxies work best for Google Maps (recommended providers:
# Bright Data, Oxylabs, Smartproxy, IPRoyal, Webshare)
#
# Example (replace with your real proxies):
# http://user:pass@gate.provider.com:10001
# http://user:pass@gate.provider.com:10002
# 192.168.1.100:8080:myuser:mypass
